        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "6803bbd5-f54d-5639-b030-17e573c76872",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: Kissed It\n- Bands: Velvet Revolver, Guns N' Roses, Stone Temple Pilots, Wasted Youth\n- People: Slash, Duff McKagan, Matt Sorum, Dave Kushner, Scott Weiland\n- Topics: hard rock supergroups, digital releases\n\nFacts:\n- On May 24, 2010, the song \"Kissed It\" was released digitally in the United States.\n- \"Kissed It\" features musicians Slash, Duff McKagan, and Matt Sorum.\n- Slash, Duff McKagan, and Matt Sorum were musicians of Velvet Revolver and former members of Guns N' Roses.\n- Velvet Revolver was an American hard rock supergroup.\n- Velvet Revolver consisted of former Guns N' Roses members Slash on lead guitar, Duff McKagan on bass and backing vocals, and Matt Sorum on drums and backing vocals.\n- Velvet Revolver also included Dave Kushner on rhythm guitar, who was formerly of Wasted Youth, and Scott Weiland, who was formerly of Stone Temple Pilots.",
